     "at most ",
     StyleBox["k", "TI"],
     " edges"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"a5404eec-3de9-4167-bef1-70817d654612"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "cc97eb9b-a402-4578-817a-f7466d1dea70"], Cell[TextData[{
