   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "00123ccd-1587-4827-836d-4fa387865a46"], Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
    "Method"], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "f6aa8824-9a70-4e6a-8768-9eb43a40a49e"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "8d64a7fa-0c28-41d0-ada2-24e6e414deae"], Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData["Automatic"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "1ed980ec-c420-437b-8eaa-5e9454068e17"],
     " (default), ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Exhaustive\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "8ffa6995-8fdf-44b9-9d9d-0b2c3f4a0c82"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Exhaustive\>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Pruning\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "spec"}]}], "}"}]], 
      "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "61a7b235-6cb6-4352-af37-620b53348f79"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Greedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "641c5b9a-55fa-420d-abd1-a649fd5c0e1b"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<RandomGreedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "7ef09cc1-b07f-4cd9-b39a-e70d0ddccf23"]
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"ecb79ec1-7279-4714-9f8a-cc0e0d818872"], 
    Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData["Automatic"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "c1242fae-d390-4d54-9ce5-0988db22afa9"],
     " resolves by the count: ",
     Cell[BoxData["All"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "f5719cba-c433-4bb1-a7bf-2cfa0afc7641"],
     " to ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Exhaustive\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "7d8cce65-f372-4cad-aff3-6052f450c31c"],
     ", the pool; a bounded or absent count to ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Greedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "f7e10bb2-5d97-49a6-8cee-f5e105eb7f65"],
     ", which takes the admissible pairs and the branches of each DAG in \
candidate order, so the count-less call is deterministic. ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<RandomGreedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "e033b6a4-090b-4089-a83d-6c166a1891a3"],
     " takes them in random order, seeded by an ambient ",
     Cell[BoxData["SeedRandom"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "274b3666-bf71-47ac-bf99-84761aaac4eb"],
     ". The class is the same under every value; ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Pruning\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "386765f7-dfcc-482f-8378-bf7f7f5c8d00"],
     " is accepted and inert, the pool having no frontier to cap."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"2396d27c-b9bd-4abc-9e52-ed6da2167489"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "bec9bb40-713a-4a07-bf13-450bca8edee3"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<Direction\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "1fa0459f-aa73-40f4-8e1a-7a3a0ed8bfca"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "5ff230a1-eede-43c5-982b-1ac6ef9c756c"], Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<BothSides\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "e0c8d1d0-490c-4a4f-9051-1bda1e51fc30"],
     " (default), ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Forward\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "c217a351-a499-4438-a3b2-182d379cb007"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Backward\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "56540742-945c-47c8-96f8-e3dbbcae41ba"]
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"17d653a8-94ab-415a-bbed-ffd2745330f4"], 
    Cell[TextData[{
     "which ends may move: ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Forward\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "c7251343-5a92-495f-b942-97799c6ef630"],
     " keeps ",
     StyleBox["p1", "TI"],
     " and extends past ",
     StyleBox["p2", "TI"],
     " only, ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Backward\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "d430a36c-5275-4893-b708-5a40968754f9"],
     " the reverse."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"fed3f00e-48e8-4a07-8d59-07f9c2231750"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "c697e1d8-80b0-4a3a-a300-0120eb403e52"], Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
    "Properties"], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "7a5535bd-67f6-48de-9d9e-ce27286e4b92"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "b4b03bc6-2e59-43a3-a14e-8f80d59ab9a6"], Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
     RowBox[{"{", "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "d6e7da45-00bc-4858-ad0e-bdb4b119c49b"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "53e02daf-53c7-414c-993f-d9a1e584b00f"], Cell[TextData[{
     "only the empty list; a rule on the extension is a local law and lives \
on ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      TemplateBox[{
        Cell[
         TextData["ExtendInfraGeodesic"]], 
        "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/ExtendInfraGeodesic", 
